sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Agent loop
    participant I as Integration
    participant L as Chat model
    participant R as MCPRuntime
    participant S as MCP server

    A->>I: before each model call
    I->>R: route_tools(latest user message, limit)
    R->>R: rank the registry, without calling any server
    opt nothing matches
        R->>S: refresh the servers that allow it
        S-->>R: tools, resources, and prompts
        R->>R: rank again
    end
    R-->>I: RoutedTools: name, description, input schema
    I->>L: request with the routed tools as framework tools
    L-->>A: tool call
    A->>I: run the tool call
    I->>R: await routed_tool(arguments)
    R->>S: call the tool through the resilience pipeline
    S-->>R: result or error
    R-->>I: CallToolResult
    I-->>A: tool result, or an error the model can act on